hideOS: the update applet, `hideos-update-applet` — a mark in the panel
once an update waits for a restart, from hideupd (os.hide.Update1), with
"Restart to update". hideOS's own, so not sent upstream. In
cosmic-applet-power's crate, which brings zbus and tokio: no new crates,
so the vendored Cargo.lock still builds it.

